---
title: Batanes Niche – Data Flow Diagram (Application Submission)
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Seeker as Job Seeker (Browser)
    participant SPA as React SPA<br/>(Frontend)
    participant AX as Axios Client<br/>(Auth Interceptor)
    participant API as Express.js<br/>/api/v1
    participant MW as Middleware<br/>(Auth + RateLimit)
    participant SVC as ApplicationService
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant REPO as Repository Layer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL / SQLite

    Seeker->>SPA: Click "Apply" on JobDetailPage
    SPA->>SPA: Open ApplicationModal
    Seeker->>SPA: Enter cover letter, attach resume URL
    SPA->>AX: POST /api/v1/applications { job_id, cover_letter, resume_url }
    AX->>AX: Attach Bearer JWT access token
    AX->>API: POST /api/v1/applications
    API->>MW: requireAuthenticated → verify JWT
    MW->>MW: requireJobSeekerContext → role check
    API->>SVC: submitApplication(seeker, appData)
    SVC->>REPO: applicationRepository.create(...)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT INTO applications (job_id, seeker_id, ...)
    DB-->>REPO: Application record
    REPO-->>SVC: Application created
    SVC->>NS: createNotification(employer, "New Application")
    NS->>REPO: notificationRepository.create(...)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications
    DB-->>REPO: Notification created
    SVC->>NS: createNotification(seeker, "Application Submitted")
    NS->>REPO: notificationRepository.create(...)
    REPO->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications
    SVC-->>API: { application object }
    API-->>AX: 201 Created { id, status:"pending", ... }
    AX-->>SPA: Response data
    SPA->>Seeker: Show success toast / update UI
